it is a statement that they are not in it. Third, where a non-linear term is convex
and piecewise linear in the decision it could be linearised and added, but that is
not done here: the program is not solved, so such an extension would add modelling
detail without adding information.

This completes the mathematical program. The online methods that approximate it are described in Sec.~\ref{sec:solutions}.
