\label{sec:metrics}

Every method was run on the identical 1.25\,h Aimsun
scenario over seeds 300--700 on both corridors at
demand $\times$1.0 (learners pre-trained on
seeds 800--1100 and frozen), and we report realised microsimulation outcomes
against the \texttt{NO\_TSP} baseline, not MILP-predicted values.  The
$Z_1$--$Z_4$ labels are shorthand for standard TSP quantities, not bespoke
metrics; the ``custom'' terms name \emph{controller internals} (the net-benefit
test and cascade that implement R1/R4 online), which are never reported as outcomes:

