M3 1.0 and M2 0.2. At the grant, the layers that win act in the
expensive-but-profitable corner. M3's median side-street flow is
425\,veh/h against 619 across all decision epochs where a controller declines, its
main approach sits at $x=0.70$ against 0.30 at declines, and its predicted cost
to others (68\,pax$\cdot$s) is a tenth of the predicted bus benefit (654). M5's
